 "description": "Group commands of a character alone (T-043): PARTY with no party, the FOLLOW/JOIN/INVITE/UNINVITE/DISBAND/AID/SHARE syntax and refusals, the ranks outside a party, and the broadcast channels JOIN N / LEAVE. Written for the differential harness, not yet run against the original. The two-session party script (party-duo) needs a second connection, which the harness does not drive.",
